QuestGuidance.Register("en",184,{
[5857]="7002673B\n1\tTalk to Nod Gardener in Oatbarton\tOatbarton is in the Shire, on the southern border with Evendim.\n",
[5858]="7000C099\n1\tTalk to Fantus\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a gold allowance.\n",
[5859]="7006C092\n1\tTBD talk to the clothier\tTBD talk to the jirush clothier\n2\tTBD collect piles of blankets (total: 3)\tTBD the clothier offered blankets\n3\tTBD talk to the grocer\tTBD talk to the jirush grocer\n4\tTBD Collect baskets of food (total: 3)\tTBD Collect baskets of food\n5\tTBD speak with the musician\tTBD speak with the jirush musician\n6\tTBD dance with the elderly\030TBD Go to the elderly hangout\t\n7\tTBD return to the compassionate caretaker\t\n",
[5860]="700088BB\n1\tDefeat Old Goldhead\tOld Goldhead may be within a bear-den near Tírith Rhaw. Taskmaster Núrsufum seems to have communicated that a great bear nearby named Goldhead may be allied with the enemy.\n2\tReturn to Taskmaster Núrsufum\tTaskmaster Núrsufum is at Tírith Rhaw. You found and destroyed Old Goldhead. Now you should return to Taskmaster Núrsufum.\n",
[5861]="70009E85\n1\tTalk to Golloval\030Collect Tokens of Valour (total: 9)\tGolloval is hidden to the west amongst the hills near the central entrance to the Isendeep Mine. He hides in the hills protected by other golden eagles. Golloval pledged to assist you in retaking the Isendeep mine if you return to him with proof of your valour within the Ettenmoors.\n",
[5862]="70000CEF\n1\tTalk to Mayor Graeme Tenderlarch\tTravel east from the Blue Mountains to the land called the Shire, then continue east along the road until you reach Bree-town. Áskell suggested that you venture out of the Blue Mountains and see the world. Travel to Bree and speak to its Mayor once you arrive.\n",
[5863]="70068396\n1\tReturn to Umaris, the fisher\030Collect striped mackerel ([see journal]/3)\030Collect silver bream ([see journal]/4)\tNow that the fish are healthy again, Umaris has asked for your help feeding the village. Bring her a mix of healthy fish for a reward.\n",
[5864]="70054F7A\n1\tFind Cannoth east of Barad Arthir\tLocate Cannoth east of Barad Arthir, the Lofty Watch-fort, and learn what happened.\n",
[5865]="70061798\n1\tBurn barrels of stolen pipe-weed at Taerhad (total: 10)\tBarrels of stolen pipe-weed can be found at Taerhad in Yondershire. Mal Ragwood has asked you to burn barrels of stolen pipe-weed to humiliate and drive off Sharkey's half-orcs at Taerhad.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have burned many barrels of stolen pipe-weed at Taerhad.\n",
[5866]="70052B1C\n1\tSet a warding totem at Fil Sulmog\030Set a warding totem at the Old Ford\030Set a warding totem at the eastern ford of Avabárg\030Set a warding totem at the den of the Hól-budlan\tWards should be placed to the north and south of Hultvís at Fil Sulmog, the Old Ford, the eastern ford to Avabárg, and the den of the Hól-budlan slightly north of Málvang. The Sorrow-well lies to the north-west of Hultvís. Atta has asked you to place carved wards throughout Woodsedge to ensure the Snatcher will never return to the Vales of Anduin. He has also asked you to place a ward at the Sorrow-well, the last known refuge of the Snatcher in Woodsedge and a cave thought to bear a curse against the Woodmen.\n2\tSet a warding totem at the Sorrow-well\tThe Sorrow-well can be found to the north-west of Hultvís. After setting warding totems throughout Woodsedge, you should now travel to the Sorrow-well and set a final warding totem.\n3\tTalk to Radagast at the Sorrow-well\tRadagast can be found at the Sorrow-well in Woodsedge. You have unexpectedly crossed paths with Radagast the Brown at the Sorrow-well. You should talk to Radagast about Atta and Úbil the Snatcher.\n4\tThe Sorrow-well can be found to the north-west of Hultvís. Radagast believes Gollum may have left something behind in the Sorrow-well.\t\n",
[5867]="70018C2D\n1\tGather apples (total: 5)\tApples can be found at Appledore's Orchard, west of the Party Tree. Samfast Longburrow has asked you to gather up some apples from the orchard so he may press them to make cider.\n2\tBring the apples to Samfast Longburrow at the Party Tree\tSamfast Longburrow is at the Party Tree in Hobbiton. Samfast will be pleased to get his hands on the apples you collected so that he can begin making cider for the Yule celebration.\n",
[5868]="70025277\n1\tTalk to Nora Strawley in Bree to receive your gift\tNora Strawley is in the Beggar's Alley in Bree. You should speak with Nora Strawley to see what Daley Utteridge has sent to you.\n",
[5869]="7004F586\n1\tGather honey (total: 10)\tYou should collect honey to bring to the Beornings. It can be found in beehives along the road to Óinsbridge.\n2\tDeliver the honey to Fiskvat in Skoghús\tYou should collect honey to bring to the Beornings.\n",
[5870]="70059435\n1\tRetrieve cured meats from the nearby crate\tA crate of cured meats can be found nearby in Trestlebridge. You should retrieve the cured meats from the crate.\n2\tChildren can be found around Trestlebridge. You should deliver the cured meats to the children of Trestlebridge.\t\n3\tTalk to Nessa Larch\tNessa Larch can be found in Trestlebridge. You should talk to Nessa Larch.\n",
[5871]="7005297F\n1\tReturn to the Beorninghús to greet your family members\tYour extended family can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin, but the Beorninghús will be a good place to begin.\n2\tHug Gírta\030Hug Grimbeorn\030Hug Hállkell\030Hug Sterkist\030Hug Varthmath\030Hug Langhár\030Hug Hertha\030Hug Skalla\030Hug Haldis\030Hug Hárskor\030Hug Ragnild\030Hug Gultheg\tYour family can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin. You should greet your family members with a hug whenever you find them among the Vales. You will need to do much within the Vales in order to encounter all your relatives.\n3\tEnter Beorn's cave at the base of the Carrock\tBeorn's cave can be found at the base of the Carrock in the Beorning-lands. You should enter Beorn's cave, a site for remembering members of your family that no longer walk or roam among the Vales.\n4\tSit in Beorn's cave and think of family members that have gone\tBeorn's cave can be found at the base of the Carrock in the Beorning-lands. Inside the cave, you should sit for a moment in quiet contemplation.\n5\tCompleted\tYou gave a thought to your family, and now that your heart and mind are at ease, you feel ready to continue your adventures.\n",
[5872]="70028CA9\n1\tCollect supply-crates (total: 3)\tThe crates of supplies can be found on the hill east of Innoth's camp. Innoth asked you to collect several of the Orkish weapon-caches.\n2\tTalk to Innoth near the Isen\tInnoth is at his camp, west of the weapons-caches. You should bring the supplies you recovered to Innoth.\n",
[5873]="7002906D\n1\tExamine shipments destined for Isengard (total: 10)\tCrates that are destined to be shipped to Isengard can be found around Galtrev. You should peek into the shipments destined for Isengard to see what Saruman might be plotting for these goods.\n2\tTalk to Gethin at the fourth worksite\tGethin is at the fourth worksite in Galtrev. Now that you have taken a good look at the various weapons and strange goods being shipped from Galtrev to Isengard, you should return to Gethin at the fourth worksite.\n",
[5874]="7002F996\n1\tCollect pristine hides from bears or láthbears (total: 5)\tPristine hides can be gathered from the black-bears and láthbears roaming east of Faldham. Getric believes that pristine bear-hides will be useful for bartering with once he reaches the capital city of Rohan.\n2\tReturn the pristine hides to the farmer, Getric\tGetric can be found preparing to leave his home, just north-east of the Mead Hall of Faldham. You have procured the hides that Getric will use to barter with in Edoras.\n",
[5875]="7006C8A4\n1\tDeliver the produce crate to Dashên in Iridír\tMeliri handed you a crate of oranges and honey to deliver to a trader named Dashên in Iridír.\n",
[5876]="70042B2F\n1\tTalk to Theodore Gorse in the Forsaken Inn\030Talk to Haley Meadowsweet in the Forsaken Inn\tTheodore Gorse and Haley Meadowsweet are in the Forsaken Inn, puzzling over the cryptic message you recovered from the strongbox in the Lone-lands.\n2\tTalk to Bingo in the Forsaken Inn\tBingo is in the Forsaken Inn, trying to figure out the meaning behind the cryptic message you recovered.\n3\tFind the second hidden strongbox, somewhere in the Lone-lands\tBingo gave you the cryptic message, and challenged you to unravel its mystery and find the treasure somewhere in the Lone-lands.\n4\tBring the three-word parchment to Theodore Gorse in the Forsaken Inn\tTheodore Gorse is in the Forsaken Inn, and will want to see the treasure you found, even if it is only a parchment with the words 'The End Now' on it.\n5\tTalk to Bingo in the Forsaken Inn\tBingo is in the Forsaken Inn, and you should tell him about the conclusion of your treasure hunt.\n",
[5877]="7005F6C1\n1\tFind the toppled echo-horn outside Drúkala in Gloomingtarn\tThe toppled echo-horn can be found just outside Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. Hersegg has asked you to find the echo-horn toppled by Hathnákh Curse-breaker in an effort to lure out the elusive Orc-captain. You should search for the toppled echo-horn near Drúkala.\n2\tStrike the toppled echo-horn and defeat Hathnákh Curse-breaker\tThe toppled echo-horn can be found just outside Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. You have found the toppled echo-horn outside Drúkala. You should strike the echo-horn and confront Hathnákh Curse-breaker.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have done as Hersegg asked and defeated Hathnákh Curse-breaker at Drúkala.\n",
[5878]="7002C4DD\n1\tCollect gorge-webs (total: 3)\tYou should gather webs from the gorge-crawlers and gorge-lurkers that hunt the northern ridge of the Limlight Gorge.\n2\tBring the gorge-webs to Captain Agelbrit\tYou should bring the webs you collected to Captain Agelbrit at the Limlight Gorge guard-post.\n",
[5879]="7000883A\n1\tReturn the feathers to Gorgoris\030Collect Sun-touched tailfeathers (total: 85)\tEagles can be found throughout the Ettenmoors. Gorgoris wishes to know that the threat against her brood is diminished before she enters the fight against the enemy. She asked you to slay the eagles and bring her their feathers as proof of the deed.\n",
[5880]="7004B59E\n1\tDeliver the Curious Goo to a collection box\030Collect Curious Goo (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Curious Goo.\n",
[5881]="7004B59A\n1\tDeliver the Intriguing Filth to a collection box\030Collect Intriguing Filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Intriguing Filth.\n",
[5882]="7004B59B\n1\tDeliver the Mysterious Ears to a collection box\030Collect Mysterious Ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Mysterious Ears.\n",
[5883]="7004B59D\n1\tDeliver the Obsidian Scales to a collection box\030Collect Obsidian Scales (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Obsidian Scales.\n",
[5884]="7004B59C\n1\tDeliver the Stony Skins to a collection box\030Collect Stony Skins (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Stony Skins.\n",
